fancy!(BARE_DAY, r###"(?i)\b(?:start|starts|starting|begin|begins|beginning|finish|finishes|finishing|end|ends|ending|leave|leaves|leaving|go|goes|going|come|comes|coming|return|returns|returning|fly|flies|flying|arrive|arrives|arriving|land|lands|landing|move|moves|moving|open|opens|opening|close|closes|closing|visit|visits|visiting|meet|meets|meeting|submit|submits|hand|hands|deliver|delivers|book|booked|due|held|happens|happen|is|are|was|were|have|has|got)\s+(?:on\s+|this\s+|next\s+)?(?:(?!and\b|but\b|because\b|if\b|[.!?])[\w']+\s+){0,3}(wednesday|thursday|saturday|weekend|tuesday|monday|sunday|friday)\b(?!\s+(?:is|was|are|were)\b)"###);
